OL,3,AHundreds of Royal Mail staff quitting
OL,4,Aeach week under new efficiency plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 400 postmen and women are leaving
OL,7,FRoyal Mail per week, according to the
OL,8,FCommunication Workers Union (CWU), who
OL,9,Fclaims this number has gone up since
OL,10,Fthe company introduced a new delivery
OL,11,Fsystem earlier this year.
OL,13,FThe CWU says the firm had been losing
OL,14,Fabout 330 postal staff a week from a
OL,15,Fworkforce of 83,000 before it rolled
OL,16,Fout DM26, which reorganised routes to
OL,17,Fimprove delivery performance.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
